    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n106292" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑδᾰτ-ηρός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>for water,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήτε κρωσσοὺς μήτ᾽ οἰνηροὺς μήθ᾽ ὑ.</span>
			<i>water-ewers</i> or <i>pails,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				96
			</span></i> (anap.), as cited by <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				6.23
			</span></i>; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑδρηροὺς πίθους καὶ
				οἰνηρούς</span> as cited in <i><span class="en">
				<u>AB</u>
				115
			</span></i>.</div>
